PROJECT: Protonabu Usage
    ROADMAP
        INCLUDED PRODUCT: Protonabu Usage Guide
        COMBINED MILESTONE [MAJOR]: My Product
            MILESTONE: My Product - Under Construction
            MILESTONE: My Product - Tested

PRODUCT: Protonabu Usage Guide
    ID
        PROPERTY ["PURPOSE"]: "to specify and guide the operative procedure for creating my Protonabu-powered DSL"
        PROPERTY ["AUTHOR"]: "Avner Ben"
            BULLET ["CREATED"]: "07-Mar-2026"
        PROPERTY ["AI"]: "Antigravity"
            BULLET ["GENERATED"]: "07-Mar-2026"

    PART: Protonabu
        CAPABILITY: to retrieve registered fact builder
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "dispatcher.loadHandlers"
            INPUT: "Fact label"
            OUTPUT: "Fact builder handler"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to query the parsing design path
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "fact.designPath[-1][1]"
            INPUT: "Design Path"
            OUTPUT: "Composite Fact"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to build fact
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "parsePage(self, fact)"
            INPUT: "Tokenized Fact"
            OUTPUT: "Composite Fact"
            OUTPUT: "Design Path -- augmented"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to parse tokenized fact
            INPUT: "tokenized AST"
            OUTPUT: "Design Fact"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to parse the facts in My App snippet
            DEFINITIVE [PART]
            INPUT: "My App snippet"
            OUTPUT: "tokenized AST"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to build My Fact-base
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "SiteParser.parse()"
            INPUT: "My App snippet"
            INPUT: "My DSL Schema"
            OUTPUT: "My DOM class definitions"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to compile My App snippet
            INPUT: "My App snippet"
            OUTPUT: "My App design fact-base"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to load schema
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "ProtonabuSchema(schema_path)"
            INPUT: "My DSL Schema snippet"
            OUTPUT: "Protonabu Schema AST"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to generate schema report
            INPUT: "My DSL Schema"
            OUTPUT: "Schema Specification report"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
    END: PART // Protonabu

    PART: Developer
        CAPABILITY: to design and build My user interface
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to design and build my other functionality
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to document my Fact Tokenizer
            INPUT: "Fact tokenizer spec"
            OUTPUT [STATE]: "Fact Argument tokenizer -- documented"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to specify my token type
            INPUT: "Token type name"
            OUTPUT: "My DSL Tokenizer library"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to define my Fact parameter modifier
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "KEYWORD [quotedName]"
            INPUT: "Fact spec"
            OUTPUT: "Fact argument modifier token type"
            OUTPUT: "Token optionality"
            OUTPUT [STATE]: "Fact spec -- flexible-parametrized"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to define my Fact label modifier
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "quotedText?"
            INPUT: "Fact spec"
            OUTPUT: "Label modifier token name"
            OUTPUT: "Token optionality"
            OUTPUT [STATE]: "Fact spec -- flexible"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to position Fact in the schema hierarchy
            INPUT: "Fact spec"
            OUTPUT [STATE]: "Fact -- positioned"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to document my Fact
            INPUT: "Fact spec"
            OUTPUT [STATE]: "Fact -- dpocumented"
            OUTPUT: "Schema fact -- commented"
            OUTPUT [STATE]: "Fact spec -- documented"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to cut repeating Fact hierarchy in my Schema
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "__DITTO__ under CONTINUATION"
            INPUT [STATE]: "My DSL Schema Snippet -- structured"
            OUTPUT [STATE]: "My DSL Schema Snippet -- recursion bounds resolved"
            OUTPUT: "Ditto schema reference"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to define my Fact
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "PAGE: quotedName"
            INPUT: "Fact name"
            OUTPUT: "Fact label"
            OUTPUT [STATE]: "Fact spec -- labeled"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to code my composite token-type interpreter
            INPUT: "Tokenizer spec"
            OUTPUT: "My DSL Tokenizer library"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to specify my Fact
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "PAGE: quotedName"
            INPUT: "Fact spec"
            OUTPUT: "Fact argument token type"
            OUTPUT: "Token optionality"
            OUTPUT [STATE]: "Fact spec -- parametrized"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to add Fact to My DSL vocabulary
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "Editing schema.facts"
            INPUT: "Fact spec"
            INPUT: "My DSL Schema snippet"
            OUTPUT: "Fact spec -- registered"
            OUTPUT: "My DSL Schema snippet -- edited"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to state my Fact
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "PAGE: Introduction"
            INPUT: "Design state"
            OUTPUT: "Fact label"
            OUTPUT: "Fact label modifier"
            OUTPUT: "Fact argument"
            OUTPUT: "Fact argument modifier"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to Use My Fact-base
            ID
                PROPERTY ["DESCRIPTION"]: "My application, running, as configured by my snippet"
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "Generated HTML site"
            INPUT: "My DOM class definitions"
            OUTPUT: "Generated artifacts"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to use My App
            INPUT: "My DSL parser"
            INPUT: "My App snippet"
            INPUT: "My DOM class definitions"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to design My Domain Object Model
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "class Book / class Page in siteModel.py"
            INPUT: "Protonabu Schema AST"
            OUTPUT: "My DOM class definitions"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to modify Fact in My DSL Vocabulary
            INPUT: "Fact spec"
            OUTPUT: "Fact spec -- modified"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to edit My DSL Schema
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to define My DSL Schema
            DEFINITIVE [PART]
            ID
                PROPERTY ["PURPOSE"]: "To define the vocabulary to be used in My application domain"
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "schema.facts"
            INPUT: "Business requirements"
            OUTPUT: "My DSL Schema Snippet"
            OUTPUT: "My DSL parser -- stubs"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to position Fact in my design
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "SECTION under CHAPTER"
            INPUT: "Fact"
            INPUT: "Parent Fact"
            OUTPUT: "Fact -- positioned"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to add Fact to My design
            INPUT: "Fact spec"
            OUTPUT: "Fact -- added"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to modify my Fact
            INPUT: "Fact"
            OUTPUT: "Fact -- modified"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to edit My App snippet
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "Editing demo_site.facts"
            INPUT: "My App snippet"
            OUTPUT: "My App snippet -- edited"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to prepare My App snippet
            ID
                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "demo_site.facts"
            INPUT: "Domain design"
            OUTPUT: "My App snippet"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to build the rest of My App
            INPUT: "My DSL Schema snippet"
            INPUT: "My DSL parser -- stubs"
            OUTPUT: "My DSL parser -- implemented"
            OUTPUT: "My App snippet"
            OUTPUT: "My DOM class definitions"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
        CAPABILITY: to author my Protonabu-powered App
            DEFINITIVE [PRODUCT]
            INPUT: "Business requirements"
            OUTPUT: "My App"
            IMPLEMENTATION [BLOCK]
    END: PART // Developer

    USE CASE: to author my Protonabu-powered App
        TITLE: Authoring my Protonabu-powered App
        USING: "Business requirements"
        GIVING: "Protonabu schema snippet"
        GIVING: "My App snippet"
        REQUIRES: to define My DSL Schema
        REQUIRES: to build the rest of My App
        REQUIRES: to use My App

    USE CASE: to define My DSL Schema
        TITLE: Defining My DSL Schema
        ID
            PROPERTY ["PURPOSE"]: "to reduce My problem domain to Labeled Facts"
            PROPERTY ["METHOD"]: "editing snippet offline"
        GIVING: "My DSL Schema Snippet"
            REQUIRES: to edit My DSL Schema
                REPEATED [UNTIL]: "DSL Schema is stable"
                REQUIRES: to add Fact to My DSL vocabulary
                    ID
                        PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "Milestone status"
                    OPTION: "Learning"
                        CRITERION
                    REQUIRES: to position Fact in the schema hierarchy
                    REQUIRES: to define my Fact
                        ID
                            PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "STATUS"
                    REQUIRES: to specify my Fact
                        ID
                            PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "uniqueEntityName"
                        OPTION: "Fact is named"
                        REQUIRES: to specify my token type
                            OPTION: "New token type"
                            GIVING [to add]: "My DSL Tokenizer library"
                            REQUIRES: to document my Fact Tokenizer
                        REQUIRES: to code my composite token-type interpreter
                            OPTION: "Structured and not yet specified"
                            GIVING [to add]: "My DSL Tokenizer library"
                        REQUIRES: to define my Fact parameter modifier
                            ID
                                PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "assignedDeveloper"
                            OPTION: "Fact parameter is flexible"
                            REQUIRES: to specify my token type
                                OPTION: "New token type"
                    END: REQUIRES // to specify my Fact
                    REQUIRES: to define my Fact label modifier
                        ID
                            PROPERTY ["EXAMPLE"]: "date?"
                        OPTION: "Fact is flexible"
                        REQUIRES: to specify my token type
                            OPTION: "New token type"
                    REQUIRES: to document my Fact
                END: REQUIRES // to add Fact to My DSL vocabulary
                REQUIRES: to modify Fact in My DSL Vocabulary
                    OPTION: "Improving"
                REQUIRES: to cut repeating Fact hierarchy in my Schema
                    OPTION: "Stabilizing"
        END: REQUIRES // to edit My DSL Schema
        REQUIRES: to load schema
        REQUIRES: to generate schema report
        REQUIRES: to design My Domain Object Model
    END: USE CASE // to define My DSL Schema

    USE CASE: to build the rest of My App
        TITLE: Building My App
            REQUIRES: to prepare My App snippet
                REQUIRES: to edit My App snippet
                    REPEATED [UNTIL]: "The DSL spec is stable"
                    REQUIRES: to add Fact to My design
                        OPTION: "Learning"
                            CRITERION
                        REQUIRES: to position Fact in my design
                        REQUIRES: to state my Fact
                    REQUIRES: to modify my Fact
                        OPTION: "Improving"
                REQUIRES: to compile My App snippet
        END: REQUIRES // to prepare My App snippet
        REQUIRES: to design and build my other functionality
        REQUIRES: to design and build My user interface
    END: USE CASE // to build the rest of My App

    USE CASE: to use My App
        TITLE: Using My App
        REQUIRES: to load schema
        REQUIRES: to build My Fact-base
            REQUIRES: to parse the facts in My App snippet
                REQUIRES: to parse tokenized fact
                    SCANNING: "Abstract Syntax tree"
                    REQUIRES: to retrieve registered fact builder
                    REQUIRES: to build fact
                        USING: "Tokenized Fact"
                        GIVING: "Composite Fact"
                        GIVING: "Fact Path"
                        REQUIRES: to query the parsing design path
        REQUIRES: to Use My Fact-base
    END: USE CASE // to use My App

    ROADMAP
        ASSIGNED DEVELOPER: Me
        MILESTONE: My Product - Under Construction
            SCHEDULED USE CASE: to author my Protonabu-powered App
            SCHEDULED USE CASE: to define My DSL Schema
            SCHEDULED USE CASE: to build  the rest of My App
        MILESTONE: My Product - Tested
            SCHEDULED USE CASE: to use My App

END: PRODUCT // Protonabu Usage Guide

